---
title: "AD-02 Pipeline Trigger Evaluation (UML Activity Diagram)"
---
flowchart TB
  start((●)) --> a1[Dequeue ci.evaluate task]
  a1 --> d1{"Head commit has [skip ci]?"}
  d1 -- yes --> stop1((◉))
  d1 -- no --> a2[List .github/workflows/* and .gitlab-ci.yml at commit]
  a2 --> d2{Any pipeline files?}
  d2 -- no --> stop1
  d2 -- yes --> loop[Take next file]
  loop --> d3{Parsed IR cached for blob sha?}
  d3 -- yes --> a4[Use cached IR]
  d3 -- no --> a3[Parse with GitHub or GitLab parser]
  a3 --> d4{Valid?}
  d4 -- no --> inv[Create run with status 'invalid' + error line] --> next
  d4 -- yes --> a4
  a4 --> d5{Event and branch/tag filters match?}
  d5 -- no --> next
  d5 -- yes --> d6{Path filters set?}
  d6 -- yes --> a5[Compute changed paths] --> d7{Any path matches?}
  d7 -- no --> next
  d7 -- yes --> a6
  d6 -- no --> a6[Expand matrix, evaluate job rules]
  a6 --> d8{Fork pull request?}
  d8 -- yes --> a7[Mark: no secrets, read-only token, needs approval]
  d8 -- no --> a8
  a7 --> a8[Create run + jobs in one transaction]
  a8 --> a9[Wake waiting runners]
  a9 --> next{More files?}
  next -- yes --> loop
  next -- no --> stop2((◉))
